sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AuthController
    participant AuthService
    participant Database
    participant TokenService

    Client->>AuthController: POST /api/auth/refresh
    AuthController->>AuthService: RefreshTokenAsync(refreshToken)
    AuthService->>Database: Find refresh token
    Database-->>AuthService: RefreshToken entity
    AuthService->>AuthService: Check if token active and not expired
    AuthService->>Database: Revoke old refresh token
    AuthService->>TokenService: GenerateRefreshToken()
    TokenService-->>AuthService: New refresh token
    AuthService->>Database: Save new refresh token
    AuthService->>TokenService: CreateToken(user)
    TokenService-->>AuthService: New JWT access token
    AuthService-->>AuthController: LoginResponseDto
    AuthController-->>Client: { newAccessToken, newRefreshToken }